You are a senior front-end engineer and UI designer. Build a complete, production-quality, single-page, fully responsive website for "Al Syed Organic Farm", an organic farm in Punjab, Pakistan that sells A2 Bilona Desi Ghee, Kashmiri Saffron, heirloom turmeric (haldi), moringa powder and other stone-ground organic staples.

Use React with plain CSS (or Tailwind with arbitrary values). Every value below is exact, so reproduce it precisely. Do not redesign, do not add sections, do not change copy. Style: premium, clean, minimal, LIGHT, fresh organic look. White and mint backgrounds, fresh leaf green, small saffron-gold accents, elegant serif headings, rounded corners, soft shadows, generous white space.

