--eyebrow: #b9822a        (small uppercase labels)
--danger-link: #a2542a    (Remove link in cart)
Always light theme. Do NOT add dark mode. Keep the same colors even if the user's OS is in dark mode.

FONTS (Google Fonts):
- Headings: "Playfair Display", weights 500, 600, 700, fallback Georgia, serif
- Body/UI: "Poppins", weights 300, 400, 500, 600, fallback system-ui, sans-serif
Base: body 15px / line-height 1.7, weight 400, color #1c2a22, background #ffffff, antialiased.
Headings: Playfair Display, weight 600, line-height 1.2, margin 0.
