LAYOUT: container max-width 1120px, side padding 24px (18px under 520px). Section vertical padding 76px (56px under 900px). The Best Sellers section container is wider: max-width 1300px.
RADII: pills and buttons 999px; cards 32px; large cards 28px; images 24px; small cards 18px.
SHADOWS: soft green-tinted only, for example 0 18px 40px rgba(31,92,58,.12).
html: smooth scrolling, scroll-padding-top 90px (so the sticky header does not cover anchors).

BUTTONS (class .btn): inline-block, padding 12px 26px, radius 999px, font Poppins 600 14px, border 2px solid.
